  "description": "The Teammachine R 01 THREE is engineered for an uncompromising race performance, shaped by the same obsessive development and Red Bull Advanced Technologies collaboration as the flagship models. Speed remains the priority – everywhere, all the time.\nOur 01 Premium Carbon layup keeps this frameset exceptionally light and brutally efficient, with stiffness exactly where a racer needs it. SRAM adds high-performance shifting and braking with their Force AXS groupset with power meter for real-time performance data. The low-stack ICS Aero Gen 2 cockpit and rapid CR 50 SL Carbon tubeless-ready wheelset form a fast, cohesive system that’s optimized to hold speed deep into the red.\nThe wide-stance fork completes the picture, reducing drag and stabilizing airflow for confidence and control at full race speed.",
